From: Antigravity kernel lane <kernel@rabbizos>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026
Subject: [PATCH] [DO NOT FLASH - TZPC HANG] arm64: dts: exynos850-a217f: enable SPI0 (0x13940000) for ET520 fingerprint probe

!!! DO NOT FLASH !!!
Tested 2026-11-19: enabling usi_spi_0 / spi_0 (0x13940000) hangs at
"booting kernel" (likely TZPC Secure World lock on SPI0 for TEE
fingerprint). Keep for reference only; do not include in boot-avb.img.

Enables usi_spi_0 and spi_0 at 0x13940000 with a spidev child node
(rohm,dh2228fv) at 12.5 MHz and keeps vdd_ldo26 (vdd_btp_3p3) on so
userspace can run et520-id-probe against the EgisTech ET520 sensor.

Lane: kernel. Device: samsung/a21s.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos850-a217f.dts | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos850-a217f.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos850-a217f.dts
index 111111111..222222222 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos850-a217f.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos850-a217f.dts
@@ -300,6 +300,7 @@
 				regulator-min-microvolt = <3300000>;
 				regulator-max-microvolt = <3375000>;
 				regulator-ramp-delay = <12000>;
+				regulator-always-on;
 			};
 
 			vdd_ldo27: ldo27 {
@@ -1480,3 +1481,19 @@
 		#sound-dai-cells = <0>;
 	};
 };
+
+/* ---- EgisTech ET520 fingerprint sensor on spi_0 (0x13940000) ------- */
+&usi_spi_0 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&spi_0 {
+	status = "okay";
+
+	spidev@0 {
+		compatible = "rohm,dh2228fv";
+		reg = <0>;
+		spi-max-frequency = <12500000>;
+	};
+};
+
